Description: Hostable SQLite browser and editor
 Liteadmin is a web-based SQLite database browser and editor. It allows you to manage your SQLite databases through a simple and intuitive web interface. With liteadmin, you can create, read, update, and delete records in your SQLite databases, as well as execute SQL queries and manage database schema.

